Práctica 5 — Playbooks
1. Playbook: instalar Notepad++ en ansible2 (Windows)
nano notepadpp.yml
---
- name: Instalar Notepad++
hosts: win
tasks:
- name: Instalar Notepad++ con Chocolatey
win_chocolatey:
name: notepadplusplus
state: present
ansible-playbook notepadpp.yml
2. Playbook: instalar y arrancar NGINX en ansible1 (Linux)
nano nginx.yml
---
- name: Instalar NGINX
hosts: linux
become: yes
tasks:
- name: Instalar nginx
dnf:
name: nginx
state: present
- name: Iniciar y habilitar nginx
service:
name: nginx
state: started
enabled: yes
ansible-playbook nginx.yml
Verificación:
ansible win -m win_shell -a "Get-Package notepadplusplus"
ansible linux -m shell -a "systemctl status nginx" -b
Qué hacer si falla:
win_chocolatey: module not found → Chocolatey debe estar instalado en el cliente Windows
primero, o usar win_chocolatey con la tarea previa de instalación de Chocolatey.
nginx falla al iniciar por puerto 80 ocupado por Apache → detener httpd primero:
ansible linux -m service -a "name=httpd state=stopped" -b
